# =============================================================================
# CampuSphere — Vercel upload boundary (M12.P1-R7)
# =============================================================================
# ALLOWLIST, not a denylist. The first rule ignores every entry in the project
# root, and only the explicitly re-included runtime surface is uploaded. A new
# root file, directory, scratch capture, evidence document, dump, or local tool
# is therefore EXCLUDED BY DEFAULT and stays out of the deployment package
# until someone deliberately adds a reviewed negation below.
#
# Semantics (same as .gitignore, per Vercel's .vercelignore documentation):
#   - `/*` matches every entry in the PROJECT ROOT only, so re-including a root
#     directory also re-includes its descendants. The explicit `!<dir>/**`
#     companion lines below state that intent instead of relying on it.
#   - Later rules win. The `public/img/sample 360` denial is therefore placed
#     AFTER the `public` re-inclusion so it cannot be silently re-included.
#
# Deliberately NOT re-included (excluded by `/*`, listed here for review):
#   .env, .env.*, .env.example        — secrets and the secret-shaped template
#   AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, *_HANDOFF.md, plan.md, ROADMAP.md, README.md, docs/
#                                     — handoffs, plans, and documentation
#   scripts/                          — probes, quality gates, and QA harnesses
#   database/                         — schema, seed, and Supabase migrations
#   *.png, *.jpg, *.jpeg, *.pdf, *.docx, *.html at root
#                                     — screenshots, evidence, and defense media
#   Dockerfile, .dockerignore, docker-compose.yml
#                                     — the separate Milestone 13 container path
#   .agents/, .claude/, .codex/, .playwright-mcp/
#                                     — local agent/tooling metadata
#   node_modules/                     — reinstalled from package-lock.json
#   .git/, .gitignore                 — version-control metadata
#   public/img/sample 360/            — owner-only local scratch panoramas
# =============================================================================

# ---- 1. Ignore every project-root entry ----
/*

# ---- 2. Re-include the required root files ----
!server.js
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!vercel.json

# ---- 3. Re-include the runtime source directories and their descendants ----
!config
!config/**
!controllers
!controllers/**
!middleware
!middleware/**
!models
!models/**
!repositories
!repositories/**
!routes
!routes/**
!services
!services/**
!utils
!utils/**
!views
!views/**
!public
!public/**

# ---- 4. Deny the local scratch panorama directory AFTER the public
#         re-inclusion, so it is neither uploadable nor CDN-addressable ----
public/img/sample 360/
public/img/sample 360/**
